		{
			can_repeat: true
			description: [
				"Use this magical bottle to sneak and right-click on the working GT machine to speed up the machine's work."
				"Of course, using such a powerful item will consume your hunger bar, and the acceleration ability will weaken as the machine level increases."
				"mechanism:"
				"Each use consumes 1 number of uses, and the number of uses is restored by 1 per second, up to 20 times (not the durability value)"
				"The machine level from steam machine to HV machine is level 0-3, and it is invalid if it is greater than HV level."
				"When the machine recipe running time is greater than 20 seconds, the time is reduced by (4-machine level) x 2 seconds"
				"When the machine recipe running time is greater than 10 seconds, the time is reduced by (4-machine level) seconds"
				"When the machine recipe running time is greater than 2 seconds, the time is reduced by (4-machine level) x 0.5 seconds"
				"Earth Blast Furnace is fixed and reduced by 5 seconds."
			]
